== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|r}} The visual effect has been changed from a simple screen flash and shake to a massive shockwave on entering each room.
* {{dlc|r}} Mama Mega!'s effect is one of the only {{dlc|nr+}} two / {{dlc|r+}} three ways a {{M|Bomb Bum}} can be destroyed.
* Mama Mega! may be a reference to the [[wikipedia:GBU-43/B MOAB|GBU-43]], known colliqually as the mother of all bombs due to its massive payload.

